<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") -%>

<div class="container my-5 max-w-2xl mx-auto bg-white p-5 rounded-4 shadow-sm border">
    <h1 class="font-serif display-6 mb-3">Privacy <em>Policy</em></h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    <hr class="my-4">

    <h5 class="fw-bold font-serif mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary">At Ocean of Chapters, we prioritize your privacy. We collect minimal personal details necessary to process your orders, deliver books, and improve your reading experience.</p>

    <h5 class="fw-bold font-serif mb-2">2. How We Use Your Data</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary">Your information is used solely for order processing, session management, and optional order updates. We never sell or share your data with third parties.</p>

    <h5 class="fw-bold font-serif mb-2">3. Cookies & Local Storage</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary">We use essential session storage to keep track of books in your cart while you browse our online catalog.</p>

    <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-top text-center">
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline-dark rounded-pill px-4">Back to Home</a>
    </div>
</div>
